        "original_id": "29aa0fe7-83dd-5ae1-903b-12dba8a2b7e4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Encore Las Vegas, Wynn Las Vegas, Las Vegas Strip, Paradise, Nevada, North Las Vegas, Nevada\n- Companies: Wynn Resorts\n- People: Steve Wynn, Tom Fazio\n- Products: Shadow Creek Golf Course\n- Topics: luxury resorts, casinos, hotels, golf courses\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Wynn built Shadow Creek, an 18-hole golf course in North Las Vegas, Nevada, in 1989.\n- Steve Wynn, born Stephen Alan Wynn and née Weinberg on January 27, 1942, is an American real estate businessman and art collector.\n- Encore Las Vegas, also called Encore at Wynn Las Vegas or Encore, is a luxury resort, casino, and hotel on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada.\n- Encore Las Vegas is connected to its sister resort, Wynn Las Vegas.\n- Wynn Resorts owns both Encore Las Vegas and Wynn Las Vegas.\n- Wynn Resorts is headed by casino developer Steve Wynn.\n- Tom Fazio designed Shadow Creek in North Las Vegas, Nevada.",
